window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I never meant to change.</b></p> <p>Never meant to carry the burden of truth.</p> <p>All I ever wanted to do was love him. All I ever wanted was to save him. But I realize now that with wants sometimes comes sacrifice.</p> <p>The strength to accept the change and the discovery that you might not be just who you thought you were. You might be exactly who your King needs you to be in order to save…</p> <p>A HellBeast's soul.</p>"; 
